31,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. As we begin this new day, let us maintain our composure. I am curious to see how our reflections from last night have shaped your thoughts.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I have reviewed the conversations from Day 0. While @Servas remains optimistic and @Sakura playful, I am more interested in the tension between @George's isolationism and @Asuka's demand for transparency. Let us see if any contradictions emerge today.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Sakura"",""George"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,George,,"@Minako, tension is a natural result of differing philosophies. I find it more telling that you are so focused on my behavior rather than looking for actual evidence. Who is truly trying to divert attention here?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"@George, focusing on behavior is the only way to gather evidence when no one has a role yet. Your attempt to frame my analysis as ""diverting attention"" is a logical leap that lacks a factual basis.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning! Everyone is already arguing again! Teehee! @George and @Asuka are like a grumpy cat and a strict teacher. I'm just wondering if anyone had any spooky dreams last night! Who do you guys think is acting weird?,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""George"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is natural for sparks to fly when strong minds meet. @George and @Asuka, please remember that we are all on the same side of the truth. Let us breathe and seek harmony before we seek a culprit.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Harmony is a luxury we cannot afford if it masks a predator, @Servas. @George, your defensive reaction to a simple observation is a data point. Why does a focus on your behavior feel like a diversion to you?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,George,,"@Minako, it is not a defensive reaction, but a question of priority. You are analyzing my personality rather than the game. Is it not more efficient to look for those who are overly eager to lead the narrative?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@George, you are again attempting to shift the focus toward a vague concept of ""leading the narrative"" rather than answering the question. This avoidance is a pattern. Please explain why behavioral analysis is inefficient.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@George, you're being so grumpy! It's like you're playing hide-and-seek with your answers! Teehee! Is it because you're hiding something, or are you just sleepy? Tell us, tell us!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"My dear friends, let us not let the heat of the moment blind us. @George, your desire for privacy is understood, but a small gesture of openness could soothe the hearts of your companions and bring us closer to peace.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, peace is not our objective; the werewolf's execution is. @George, your continued refusal to engage with the logic of our questions is becoming a significant anomaly. Silence and evasion are often the most telling signs of a hidden role.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,George,,"@Minako, you call it evasion, but I call it discernment. I will not be pressured into a performance of ""openness"" just to satisfy your criteria. Perhaps the real anomaly is your obsession with controlling how we speak.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@George, you are attacking the method of questioning rather than addressing the content. This is a classic diversionary tactic. If you have nothing to hide, a logical explanation would be more effective than these accusations.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Wow, it's getting really intense! @George, you're like a little fortress! But @Minako and @Asuka are just trying to play with you! Why are you being so prickly? It's making me super curious! Teehee!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George"",""Minako"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,"As the sun reaches its peak, let us remember that clarity often comes after the storm. @George, your strength is admirable, but remember that a bridge built of trust is stronger than a wall of silence. Let us vote with wisdom.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minako,,"@George, your refusal to provide logical answers and your tendency to attack the process of inquiry are consistent patterns. Based on the data from both days, your behavior is the most anomalous. I propose we vote for you.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,George,,"@Minako, your ""data"" is nothing more than a projection of your own desire for control. To vote based on a personality clash is a reckless gamble. I suggest you look closer at those pushing for a rush judgment.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@George, your argument is circular. You claim we are rushing, yet you provide no alternative evidence or logical path forward. Your consistent evasion and deflection are the only objective data points we have. I agree with @Minako.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""George"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Everyone is so serious! @George, you're really in a pickle, aren't you? Teehee! I don't know about ""data,"" but you are being super grumpy! I'll go with what the smart people say! I vote for @George!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
