64,2,1,talk,Servas,,It is a heavy heart with which we wake to find George gone. May we find peace in the knowledge that we acted with the conviction of our collective reason. Let us now seek the truth with renewed clarity.,"{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, peace is secondary to the result. George was executed, but Minako was attacked. This suggests the werewolf is still among us and likely felt threatened by her logical approach. We must now analyze who benefits most from her silence.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""George"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Oh no! Poor @Minako got attacked! That's so scary! Does that mean the werewolf is a big meanie who doesn't like logic? I'm shaking just thinking about it! Who do you think did it? Teehee!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Servas,,"It is a tragedy that we have lost two of our companions so quickly. @Asuka, your observation is keen, but let us not let fear cloud our judgment. Perhaps the werewolf simply feared the truth.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, fear is not my concern; logic is. The werewolf targeted Minako because she was the primary driver of the behavioral analysis. This confirms that the werewolf finds a structured, evidence-based approach dangerous. We must continue that analysis.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Asuka, you're so smart! It's like you're a detective in a movie! If the werewolf is scared of logic, then they must be really nervous right now, right? I wonder who's the most nervous! Teehee!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, the air is thick with tension. @Asuka, your dedication to logic is a beacon, but let us remember that the werewolf may also mimic such patterns to blend in. We must remain vigilant yet compassionate.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, your warning about mimicry is logically sound, but we must apply it to the current evidence. You have consistently advocated for ""harmony"" and ""peace,"" which are vague concepts that can easily mask a hidden agenda. Why do you prioritize emotion over the analysis of the attack?","{""words"":47,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Asuka is asking some really tough questions! @Servas, are you trying to make us all sleepy with your peace and harmony talk while the werewolf is sneaking around? Teehee! This is getting so mysterious!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Servas,,"My dear Asuka, my heart seeks harmony because a divided house is easily dismantled. I do not prioritize emotion over analysis, but rather suggest that a calm spirit sees more clearly. I am merely a humble observer.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, being a ""humble observer"" is a convenient position that avoids accountability. Your constant redirection toward emotional stability serves as a distraction from the objective facts. If you are not the werewolf, provide a logical reason for your avoidance.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Asuka is really on a roll! It's like a big interrogation! @Servas, you're being all mysterious again! Are you a secret agent or something? Teehee! I'm getting super curious now! Who's the real bad guy?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
